    "type": "game",
    "name": "Hell Moon Harvest",
    "steam_appid": 3547430,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/extras/94fae760c8f2be075396e1bbb152f575.avif?t=1746198093\" data-has-big width=800 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The colonies are starving, get out there and harvest some food! Your crew of desperate workers must enter the dangerous environments of the Bio-Cubes (large wildlife reserve cubes), and collect enough food to meet quota. Food is everything in this world, you'll need it to feed the hungry colonists, buy tools and equipment, and keep yourselves alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/extras/3ed003c034675c49c1abb0f5e7be3cea.poster.avif?t=1746198093\" width=800 height=333 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/extras/3ed003c034675c49c1abb0f5e7be3cea.webm?t=1746198093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore randomly generated levels, you never know what you'll encounter next time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will the RNG be with or against you?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/extras/bdcc42ab7ed091ad90bb53e5e962a896.poster.avif?t=1746198093\" width=800 height=461 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/extras/bdcc42ab7ed091ad90bb53e5e962a896.webm?t=1746198093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escalating events, harvest what you can and get out before the weather or worse turns on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Was the weather always this bad?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/extras/9dd3bee18a4cb5db0e09a594529fa059.avif?t=1746198093\" data-has-big width=800 height=356 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Biomes, each featuring unique mobs, items, traps, events, and decor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Day trips to Toxic Wasteland on sale now!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/extras/5303fde2c0287fdd7fe612913647b981.avif?t=1746198093\" data-has-big width=800 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival of the fittest, from hunted to hunter. Start the game defenseless and only capable of picking some crops. Later acquire weapons and turn the tables on those terrible creatures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Meat's back on the menu.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/extras/097aa94feeb740892593b1721f9515b5.avif?t=1746198093\" data-has-big width=800 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of tools for the job: guns, grenades, garden tools, medieval weapons, even monster parts, whatever gets the job done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A tool for every job.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/extras/840ab397167cdd6ed4ec8b39a1ea72e9.avif?t=1746198093\" width=620 height=516 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/extras/94fae760c8f2be075396e1bbb152f575.avif?t=1746198093\" data-has-big width=800 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The colonies are starving, get out there and harvest some food! Your crew of desperate workers must enter the dangerous environments of the Bio-Cubes (large wildlife reserve cubes), and collect enough food to meet quota. Food is everything in this world, you'll need it to feed the hungry colonists, buy tools and equipment, and keep yourselves alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/extras/3ed003c034675c49c1abb0f5e7be3cea.poster.avif?t=1746198093\" width=800 height=333 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/extras/3ed003c034675c49c1abb0f5e7be3cea.webm?t=1746198093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore randomly generated levels, you never know what you'll encounter next time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will the RNG be with or against you?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/extras/bdcc42ab7ed091ad90bb53e5e962a896.poster.avif?t=1746198093\" width=800 height=461 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/extras/bdcc42ab7ed091ad90bb53e5e962a896.webm?t=1746198093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escalating events, harvest what you can and get out before the weather or worse turns on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Was the weather always this bad?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/extras/9dd3bee18a4cb5db0e09a594529fa059.avif?t=1746198093\" data-has-big width=800 height=356 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Biomes, each featuring unique mobs, items, traps, events, and decor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Day trips to Toxic Wasteland on sale now!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/extras/5303fde2c0287fdd7fe612913647b981.avif?t=1746198093\" data-has-big width=800 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival of the fittest, from hunted to hunter. Start the game defenseless and only capable of picking some crops. Later acquire weapons and turn the tables on those terrible creatures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Meat's back on the menu.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/extras/097aa94feeb740892593b1721f9515b5.avif?t=1746198093\" data-has-big width=800 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of tools for the job: guns, grenades, garden tools, medieval weapons, even monster parts, whatever gets the job done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A tool for every job.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547430/extras/840ab397167cdd6ed4ec8b39a1ea72e9.avif?t=1746198093\" width=620 height=516 /></span></p>",
